WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000 align:middle line:84%
I need to create a to-do list
to share with just my team

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.770 align:middle line:90%
without my client seeing it.

4
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.230 align:middle line:84%
To do that, I'll
just make it private.

5
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.870 align:middle line:84%
Let's click the New
To-Do List button here.

6
00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.610 align:middle line:84%
Then we'll give
it a name and then

7
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.650 align:middle line:90%
check this Private option here.

8
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.379 align:middle line:84%
When I create this list,
I'll see a red private tag

9
00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:18.930 align:middle line:84%
to let me know that only
my team is seeing it.

10
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.790 align:middle line:84%
Then I can add
tasks to it, knowing

11
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.500 align:middle line:84%
it's hidden from the
client for this project.

12
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.000 align:middle line:90%
